 "remarks": "*** 6-month lease available at a higher price *** Discover a beautifully reimagined South Wilton luxury home, completed in 2026 and ready to enjoy! Over $800K invested in an extensive renovation and a 1,000+ sq. ft. addition transforms this sun-filled, approximately 3,700 sq. ft. home with 4 bedrooms, 3.5 baths, and a 3-car garage into an exceptional turnkey home. Soaring cathedral and vaulted ceilings, oversized Andersen windows, and hardwood floors create bright, inviting spaces. The open main level features a designer kitchen with premium KitchenAid appliances, abundant cabinetry, and a walk-in pantry, flowing into elegant dining and living rooms overlooking beautifully landscaped, private grounds. A charming family room with exposed beams and a cathedral ceiling is ideal for entertaining or relaxing. Upstairs, the newly built primary suite impresses with vaulted ceilings, oversized windows, a spacious fitted walk-in closet, and a luxurious bath. Three additional bedrooms include one ensuite; a dedicated second-floor laundry adds convenience. Extensive upgrades include HVAC, plumbing, electrical, roofs, windows, doors, lighting, and finishes, plus a finished lower level. Enjoy a low-maintenance composite deck with cable railings, a refreshed covered porch, manicured landscaping, and a whole-house Generac generator. Move right in and enjoy the luxury of having it all done!",
